  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b><strong>UP Scholarship Short Details :</strong></b> As per the latest updates from the official portal, Social Welfare Department, Uttar Pradesh has released the notification for the <strong>Class 09-10th Pre Matric, 11th-12th Post Matric and Post Matric Other than Intermediate</strong> Scholarship 2025-26. for which the online application process has started from <strong>02 July 2025 to 30 October 2025 (Pre Matric, Post Matric) and 10 July 2025 to 20 December 2025 (Post Matric Other than Intermediate)</strong>. </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Any candidate who is interested to fill this form, they should check eligibility, age limit &amp; must read the Full Notification Before applying for the UP Scholarship Online Form 2025. Those Candidates Are Interested in the following admission can apply online from the link given below.</span></div>\n<div></div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"; width: 100.405%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Social Welfare Department, Uttar Pradesh</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP Scholarship Online Form 2025-26</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UP Scholarship Scheme 2025-26 : Short Details of Notification</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"; width: 100.405%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>09-10th Pre Matric&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start :<strong> 02 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Registration Last Date : <strong>30 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date For Form Complete : <strong>31 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date For Submission of Hard Copy To College : <strong>04 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Send Scholarship in Bank Account Date :&nbsp;<strong>31 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>11th-12th Post Matric&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start :<strong> 02 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Registration Last Date : <strong>30 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date For Form Complete : <strong>31 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date For Submission of Hard Copy To College : <strong>04 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Send Scholarship in Bank Account Date :&nbsp;<strong>31 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Matric Other than Intermediate&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start :<strong> 10 July 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Registration Last Date : <strong>20 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date For Form Complete : <strong>20 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date For Submission of Hard Copy To College : <strong>24 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Send Scholarship in Bank Account Date :&nbsp;<strong>24 January 2025</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"; width: 100.405%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee </b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">No Application Fees For Any Candidates&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"; width: 100.405%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP Scholarship Online Form 2025 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Not Specified</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"; width: 100.405%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP Scholarship 2025 : Documents Required</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to attach the following documents along with the Hard copy of the Online Application Form:</span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Qualifying Exam Mark Sheet</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Caste Certificate</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Income Certificate</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Bank Passbook</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Receipt Number</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Annual Non Refundable Amount</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Enrollment Number</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Aadhar Card Number</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Latest Passport Size Scan Photo</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Renewal Candidates –</strong> Kindly Use Last Year Registration Number to Login to Renewal Section and Enter the Fresh Details</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"; width: 100.405%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Form Details For UP Scholarship 2025</strong></span></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 32.1622%;\"><span style=\"color: #008000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Scholarship Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 66.8919%;\"><span style=\"color: #008000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Class</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 32.1622%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Matric</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 66.8919%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Class 09th &amp; Class 10th</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 32.1622%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Post Matric</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 66.8919%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Class 11th &amp; Class 12th</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 32.1622%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Dashmottar</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 66.8919%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">UG / PG / Diploma &amp; Certificate Courses</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"; width: 100.405%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria For UP Scholarship 2025</strong></span></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 32.1622%;\"><span style=\"color: #008000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Criteria</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 66.8919%;\"><span style=\"color: #008000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 32.1622%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Domicile</span></td>\n<td style=\"; width: 66.8919%; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates hailing from Uttar Pradesh and having Domicile of Uttar Pradesh can only avail this Scholarship facility.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 32.1622%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Matric</span></td>\n<td style=\"; width: 66.8919%; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For Class 09th candidates they should clear their class 8th level of examination and enrolled with Class 09th &amp; For Class 10th candidates they should clear their class 09th level of examination and enrolled with Class 10th can fill this Scholarship Form.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 32.1622%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Post Matric</span></td>\n<td style=\"; width: 66.8919%; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For Class 11th candidates they should clear their class 10th level of examination and enrolled with Class 11h &amp; For Class 12th candidates they should clear their class 11th level of examination and enrolled with Class 12th can fill this Scholarship Form.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 32.1622%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Dashmottar</span></td>\n<td style=\"; width: 66.8919%; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must be enrolled in any UG / PG / Diploma / Certificate Examination can fill up this scholarship form.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"; width: 100.405%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP Scholarship Online Form 2025 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link provided below they can also apply through official site of the UP Scholarship before the due date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Note :</strong></span> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">Those who are already registered themselves last year they need to renew the current form they will consider as old users &amp; renewal candidates.</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You can check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result</a> notification here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now</a>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"; width: 100.405%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Offline Submission for UP Scholarship Form 2025</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After filling the Online Scholarship Form candidates need to take the print put of complete form and after that they have to attach relevant documents (specified above) &amp; are required to send it to the respective College / School / Institution before due Date.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px; width: 100.405%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">IF You Satisfied By</span>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\">SarkariExam.com</a> <span style=\"color: #008000;\">(Website) Please Share With More People.</span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>One Time Registration (OTR)</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://scholarship.up.gov.in/Popup.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener n